    "1 site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "100 × (½ deep-work share + ½ focus share) − switching penalty − distraction penalty. Meetings are left out. Moving between focus apps, like the terminal and the docs in your browser, isn't a switch, and neither is a glance under 30 seconds. A detour of up to 3 minutes doesn't end a deep-work stretch, as long as three quarters of the stretch is focus work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "100 ×（½ 深度工作占比 + ½ 专注占比）− 切换扣分 − 分心扣分。会议不计入。在专注类应用之间切换（比如终端和浏览器里的文档）不算切换，30 秒以内的短暂查看也不算。只要一段时间里有四分之三是专注工作，3 分钟以内的岔开不会打断深度工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A guess made without a model; choose the right category to fix it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有模型时的猜测；选择正确的类别来修正"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project is the git repository an agent worked in, wherever it's checked out, or else its folder. Time counts while at least one of its sessions was working, so sessions in parallel count once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目是智能体工作所在的 git 仓库（不论检出在哪里），没有仓库时就是它的文件夹。只要项目中有一个会话在工作就计时，并行的会话只算一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI · %@ confidence": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI · 置信度%@"
