    "Every app and site from the last 30 days is covered by a rule or has been reviewed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "过去 30 天的每个应用和网站都有规则覆盖，或已经审核过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First worked on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For sessions recorded by your HAPI hub, Weft uses only HAPI history and skips local logs. Saved HAPI history stays authoritative when syncing is off or unavailable; other sessions use local logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对于 HAPI hub 已记录的会话，Weft 只使用 HAPI 历史，不再解析本地日志。关闭同步或无法连接时，仍以已保存的 HAPI 历史为准；其他会话使用本地日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All categories": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有类别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以后 %@ 都归为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HAPI history follows the turns and waits reported by your hub. For local-log sessions, work runs from your prompt until the answer, excluding permission waits and long silences. Read Again rebuilds only local-log history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HAPI 历史以 hub 报告的回合和等待时间为准。本地日志会话从提示开始计时，直到回复结束，扣除权限等待和长时间静默。“重新读取”只重建本地日志历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App / Site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用 / 网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App bundle ID": {
      "localizations": {
