          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting on agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待智能体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Week": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Week of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 这一周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weft uses HAPI history when available, otherwise reads the session logs Claude Code, Codex and pi keep on this Mac. It keeps only session titles, project folders and times; prompts and replies are never stored or sent anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weft 优先使用 HAPI 的历史；未被 HAPI 记录的会话才读取本机 Claude Code、Codex 和 pi 的日志。它只保留会话标题、项目文件夹和时间，从不保存或发送提示和回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weft uses the new language after it relaunches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weft 重新启动后会使用新的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Weft": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Weft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What belongs here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪些内容属于这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While an agent works for you, time away from the Mac adds to tracked time, up to this long after you leave, and time in distracting categories shows as waiting instead of distracted. The Focus Score only ever looks at your own activity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体为你工作时，离开 Mac 的时间会计入记录时间（离开后最多这么久），处于分心类别的时间显示为等待而不是分心。专注分只看你自己的活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with OpenAI and any server with a compatible Chat Completions API, such as OpenRouter, DeepSeek, Ollama or LM Studio. Weft sends it the apps and sites it doesn't know with their window titles, the apps, sites and window titles behind each work stream, and your daily totals. The API key is kept in your keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 OpenAI 以及任何兼容 Chat Completions API 的服务器，例如 OpenRouter、DeepSeek、Ollama 或 LM Studio。Weft 会向它发送不认识的应用和网站及其窗口标题、每个工作流背后的应用、网站和窗口标题，以及你的每日合计。API 密钥保存在你的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your HAPI hub doesn't report agent activity yet. Update the hub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 HAPI hub 还不能报告智能体活动。请更新 hub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules take priority over %lld built-in rules. More specific matches (title, URL) win over domains, which win over apps. Anything no rule matches is classified by the model chosen in Settings, or guessed when there is none.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的规则优先于 %lld 条内置规则。更具体的匹配（标题、网址）优先于域名，域名优先于应用。没有规则匹配的内容由设置中选择的模型分类；没有模型时则靠猜测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "between apps and sites": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在应用和网站之间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hapi isn't installed, or isn't anywhere Weft looks. Choose it below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 hapi，或不在 Weft 查找的位置。请在下方选择它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hapi isn't signed in to a hub. Run `hapi auth login`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "hapi 尚未登录 hub。请运行 `hapi auth login`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "high": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in stretches of 25 min or more": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连续 25 分钟以上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "incl. %@ away while agents worked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "含智能体工作时离开的 %@"
          }
        }
      }
